<div class="row inset">
  <section class="col col-720 col-space-l-top">
    <h2 class="heading--box-gitlilac">Who can get an adviser</h2>

    <p>
      To sign up for an adviser, you must:
      <ul>
        <li>
          have or be studying towards a bachelor's degree, with a grade or predicted grade of 2:2 or higher (or equivalent)
        </li>
        <li>
          not yet be a qualified teacher
        </li>
        <li>
          be interested in becoming a secondary school teacher
        </li>
      </ul>
    </p>

    <p>If you got your qualifications outside the UK, <a href="tel:08003892500">call us on 0800 389 2500</a> to check if you’re eligible.</p>

    <p>If you’re a veteran, you do not need to have or be studying for a degree to get support from an adviser. <a href="tel:08003892500">Call us on 0800 389 2500</a> to get an adviser.</p>
    <%= render "content/shared/quotes/quote_advisers_habiba" %>
  </section>
</div>
